<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Investec to manage Namibian govt pension portfolio.</title>
<headline>Investec to manage Namibian govt pension portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investec Asset Management announced on Thursday it had been appointed manager of the Namibian Government Institutions Pension Fund's development capital portfolio of more than N$175 million.</p>
</text>
